Package: cellfiers
Type: Package
Title: Cell Phenotyping and Spatial Analysis for Multiplex Imaging
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Zihan",family = "Chen",email = "Porpax.chen@outlook.com",role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Imports single-cell measurements exported by 'QuPath', applies
    sample-specific marker thresholds and user-defined phenotyping rules, and
    supports user-selected region filtering, field-of-view rasterisation,
    quality control, arbitrary centre-target radius neighbourhood analysis,
    shared-target weighting, group comparisons, and heat-pie visualisation of
    multiplex immunofluorescence imaging data.
License: CC BY 4.0
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
biocViews: ImmunoOncology, Spatial, DataImport, CellBasedAssays
